      "comment": "WHERE'S MICK (3) has been in the minors the last two, the latest showing strong pace early but gathered in and finished a 2.25 lengths third over 390m Ballarat in 22.53. One of the leading chances. MUG SCIENCE (4) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (22.78) last time in a T3 RSTW at Shepparton. Expected to feature in the finish. FRIDA SCIENCE (2) showed good early speed and led throughout to score her maiden two back then finished fourth last start and beaten 5.5 lengths at Horsham over 410m (24.03). Drawn well from box 2. Well placed here and should do much better. LEKTRA EDGE (6) cannot be underestimated.",
